  "title": {
    "zh": "复原四段耗电",
    "en": "Recover Four Power Readings"
  },
  "concept": {
    "zh": "累计抄表 · 原地拆分 · 保留校验号",
    "en": "Cumulative meter readings · In-place recovery"
  },
  "brief": {
    "zh": "电表在四个区段结束时各记一次累计耗电。地址 0 到 3 按时间存着四次累计值，开始前电表为 0。把每格改成对应区段单独用了多少电，例如地址 1 应只含第二段耗电。地址 4 的校验号留原样，ACC 留下四段合计。一份指令通过五组记录。",
    "en": "A meter logged its running total after each of four segments, starting from zero. Addresses 0 through 3 hold those four readings in order. Replace each cell with power used during that segment alone. For example, address 1 should represent only the second segment. Keep the audit ID at address 4 and leave the total of all four segments in ACC. Pass all five logs with one program."
  },
